'''Ritual Cat''' (ネコ火祭り, ''Neko Hi Matsuri'', '''Cat Fire Festival''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Salaryman Awakes!]]. He was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ritual Cat
|image = E 279.png
|appearance = [[Salaryman Awakes!|Salaryman Awakens!]]
|money drop = 1,250¢ - 4,937¢
}}

==Enemy==
Ritual Cat has average health and damage for a typical boss enemy, but makes up for it by appearing in small groups in its awakening stages. It possesses a fast attack rate, an ability to increase 100% attack power at 50% health, and supported by enemies with fast attack rates (such as [[Shy Boy]]) or long range attacks (such as [[Le'noir]]), which can easily break through the player's defence if they are not prepared.

